# Without this, running the tests alone creates __pycache__/ directories and
# `git status --porcelain` reports THREE changed paths for a workspace where no work
# was done at all. C-B's worktree provenance would then hand a successful-nothing run a
# passing `files changed > 0` -- the exact false negative this epic exists to detect,
# reproduced inside its own measurement harness. Found by running the harness against
# the degenerate baseline, 2026-08-22.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
